    {
      "_id": "AAPqloGazfuofM8y",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!B4nqUk8dojvCw97H.AAPqloGazfuofM8y",
      "name": "Mortal Days",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Hal is the grandson of Norwegian fishermen from Ballard. He spent his summers on the Bering Sea, on boats where someone died every season. He was the one who never got seasick, the one who went out on deck in thirty-foot waves. In 1994, a storm sank his boat. He was the only one who made it to shore alive, half frozen, on a beach where Montgomery was hunting.</p>\n"
      },
      "sort": 200000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 2
      },
      "flags": {
        "seattle-by-night": {
          "origen": "pagina"
        }
      },
      "_stats": {
        "coreVersion": "14.365",
        "systemId": "wod5e",
        "systemVersion": "5.3.28"
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "IP5jHBaOWmN2mNUz",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!B4nqUk8dojvCw97H.IP5jHBaOWmN2mNUz",
      "name": "Kindred Nights",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Montgomery (@UUID[JournalEntry.1UgmJAqeofD7SSaf]{Ethan Montgomery}) Embraced him that night because he saw someone who didn&#39;t know how to give up. Since then Hal has been one of Whitmore&#39;s Wolves (@UUID[JournalEntry.azX1hjbc0PUp2AA2.JournalEntryPage.bxduXJhh2oXcM6Uy]{COT-01 · Whitmore's Wolves}): he tracks, covers up, and keeps watch. He has known David for thirty years. He was the backup who reached the apartment the night Emily died, and he was the one who cleaned up the scene while David was still on his knees. They never talked about it. He feeds on fishermen and longshoremen in the waterfront bars (<em>Alleycat</em>).</p>\n"
      },
      "sort": 300000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 2
      },
      "flags": {
        "seattle-by-night": {
          "origen": "pagina"
        }
      },
      "_stats": {
        "coreVersion": "14.365",
        "systemId": "wod5e",
        "systemVersion": "5.3.28"
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "EaelW84UvSzoY7Ex",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!B4nqUk8dojvCw97H.EaelW84UvSzoY7Ex",
      "name": "Connection to the Coterie",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>The File has a 2023 cell phone video of a man running after a car faster than the car. It&#39;s him.</p>\n"
      },
      "sort": 400000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 2
      },
